>>__ load "simpLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `solver_ss`

``` hol4
simpLib.solver_ss : Traverse.ssolver -> simpLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Creates an anonymous fragment containing one unsafe solver.
Installing it has the same effect as `add_unsafe_solver`.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val decide : Traverse.ssolver = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE};
>> simpLib.SIMP_CONV
     (simpLib.++ (boolSimps.bool_ss,simpLib.solver_ss decide))
     [arithmeticTheory.LESS_MOD] “x MOD (x + 1)”;
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_unsafe_solver`](#simpLib.add_unsafe_solver),
[`simpLib.safe_solver_ss`](#simpLib.safe_solver_ss).
